<title>FRANCE: French company offers two-wheel taxis.</title>
<headline>French company offers two-wheel taxis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Paris taxi company is taking hurried business people on motorcycles to beat the French capital's crippling rush-hour traffic jams.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no other way of being sure of getting to an appointment on time,&quot; Jean-Christophe Saliou, head of the SP2 taxi company, told TF1 television.</p>
<p>The motorcycle drivers carry extra leather jackets and helmets for customers to don over business suits.</p>
</text>
